@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Home";
    var appVersion = $"v{typeof(MvcApplication).Assembly.GetName().Version}";
}
<style>
    .fw-400 {
        font-weight: 400;
    }
</style>

<div class="jumbotron">
    <h1>Welcome to <span class="badge badge-primary">JIS</span><span class="badge badge-light">@appVersion</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">This project was initiated to provide the development team a SMITS-ETG-standard ASP.NET MVC template framework as the starting point in creating web-based projects.</p>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="fw-400">Features</h2>
        <ul style="list-style: disc;">
            <li>Standard forms to perform CRUD operations</li>
            <li>Approval Workflow</li>
            <li>InfoSec-compliant data security settings</li>
            <li>Standard User Interface</li>
            <li>Common application features (mailer, logger, error handler)</li>
            <li>SFTP integration</li>
            <li>Standard system administration module</li>
            <li>SMITS Support Team administration module</li>
            <li>Application support module</li>
            <li>Cryptography using GnuPG</li>
            <li>Real-time Notifications</li>
            <li>Ad-Hoc Reports</li>
            <li>Approval Workflow</li>
            <li>OWASP Top 10 for .NET Compliant</li>
            <li>Admin Dashboard</li>
            <li>User Dashboard</li>
            <li>Two-Factor Authentication (E-mail, SMS, TOTP)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="fw-400">Technologies and Components</h2>
        <ul style="list-style: disc;">
            <li>ASP.NET MVC 5.2.7</li>
            <li>ASP.NET Razor 3.2.9</li>
            <li>Entity Framework 6.1.3</li>
            <li>Bootstrap 4.5</li>
            <li>Popper 1.16.0</li>
            <li>jQuery 3.5.1</li>
            <li>jQuery Validation 1.19.1</li>
            <li>jQuery Unobtrusive Validation 3.2.3</li>
            <li>Microsoft Owin 3.0.1</li>
            <li>Kendo.MVC 2021.3.1207.545</li>
            <li>NewtonSoft.Json 12.0.0.0</li>
            <li>ReportViewer WebForms 12.0.0</li>
            <li>Renci.SshNet 2016.1.0</li>
            <li>Renci.SshNet.Async 1.4.0</li>
            <li>GPG 2.2.7</li>
            <li>OTP Sharp 1.3.0.4</li>
            <li>SignalR 2.4.3</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="fw-400">Things to do after downloading this framework</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Rename all the projects that correspond to the project to be developed</li>
            <li>Rename the namespaces except the <code>TWC.IMS.Common*</code>, <code>ReportBuilder</code> projects</li>
            <li>Rename also the project folders and the solution file</li>
            <li>Change the project port number in the Project's Properties</li>
            <li>Reset to <code>1.0.0.0</code> the Assembly and File versions of the *.Web project, but not the version numbers of other projects</li>
            <li>Resolve the missing nuget packages, if any</li>
            <li>Upgrade the target .NET framework, if needed</li>
            <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#col3More" id="more3">More</a>
            <div class="collapse" id="col3More">
                <li>
                    Change the Bootstrap theme that complies with the agreed color scheme by the BU
                    <ol>
                        <li>Go to <a href="https://bootstrap.build/app/4.5" target="_blank">https://bootstrap.build/app/</a></li>
                        <li>Import the <code>_variable.scss</code> file</li>
                        <li>Adjust the color values, font sizes, as needed</li>
                        <li>Export the updated <code>_variable.scss</code>, <code>bootstrap.css</code>, and the <code>boostrap.min.css</code> file</li>
                        <li>Replace these files in your project</li>
                        <li>or, you can download a new and fresh theme from <a href="https://bootswatch.com/" target="_blank">https://bootswatch.com/</a></li>
                        <li>or, you create your custom css file to overwrite Bootstrap's default values</li>
                        <li>For the kendo theme, you need to replace the color codes manually using the hex values from the exported bootstrap styles.</li>
                    </ol>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Change the app brand logos as well
                    <ol>
                        <li>Generate the logo images by following the image dimensions in <code>content/images/logo</code>.</li>
                        <li>Replace the image files.</li>
                    </ol>
                </li>
                <li>You may opt to change the <code>Oops</code> images as well located in <code>content/images/oops</code>.</li>
                <li>Update the keep session alive localStorage values in the scripts/application/keep-session-alive.js (lns 21-23)</li>
                <li>Project database can be found in ETGDEVQA SQL server (Catalog Name: BPS.Qas)</li>
                <li>Standard Reports datasource files under <code>*.Web\Properties\DataSources</code> folder must also be renamed, and the <code>TypeInfo</code> element inside the file must also be updated.</li>
                <li>
                    <code>web.config</code> file changes
                    <ol>
                        <li>Change the default <code>SMITS_ADMIN_USERNAME</code> session value in the <code>web.config</code> file (ln21), comma-delimited</li>
                        <li>Update the connection string in the <code>web.config</code> file (ln13)</li>
                        <li>Keep the <code>BPS_VERSION_USED</code> value in the <code>web.config</code> file (ln20) to @appVersion</li>
                        <li>Change the <code>APP_NAME</code> value in the <code>web.config</code> file (ln23)</li>
                        <li>Change the machine <code>validationkey</code> in the <code>web.config</code> file (ln51), if needed</li>
                        <li>Keep other <code>appSettings</code> values as-is unless otherwise necessary.</li>
                    </ol>
                </li>
            </div>
            <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#col3More" id="less3" style="display:none;">Less</a>
        </ol>
        <div class="alert alert-warning">Should get the latest version from the <strong>QAS branch</strong>.</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <h2 class="fw-400">Ready to deploy?</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Change the ENVIRONMENT value in the web.config file (ln24) to QAS or PRD. Default is DEV.</li>
            <li>The project should be published in <strong>Release</strong> mode.</li>
            <li>
                For Non-SSL/TLS Setup
                <ol>
                    <li>Before publish, code block from ln39-48 must be commented.</li>
                    <li>After publish, forms/requireSSL value must be set to <strong>false</strong></li>
                    <li>After publish, httpCookies/requireSSL values must be set to <strong>false</strong></li>
                    <li>After publish, &lt;rewrite&gt; element and its subs must be removed.</li>
                    <li>After publish, httpProtocol/customHeaders/Strict-Transport-Security must be removed.</li>
                </ol>
            </li>
            <li>
                For SSL/TLS Setup
                <ol>
                    <li>No other configuration changes should be made.</li>
                </ol>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4" style="background-color:rgba(241,241,241,0.44);"></div>

    <div class="col-md-4" style="background-color:rgba(241,241,241,0.44);"></div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-12 mt-5">
        <h2 class="fw-400">Release Notes</h2>
